        "recommendation": "The combobox keeps DOM focus and points to the highlighted option with aria-activedescendant, so the browser draws no focus ring on the option: sighted keyboard users see which size Arrow keys, Enter and Tab will choose only through the `option--active` style. No stylesheet defining `option--active` (or `.size-picker`) exists in the repository. Check that a stylesheet gives `.option--active` a visible indicator with at least 3:1 contrast against adjacent colours (WCAG 2.4.7 Focus Visible, 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast), and that options on phones are at least 24 by 24 CSS pixels (2.5.8 Target Size (Minimum)), the mis-tap problem the proposal addresses.",
